{
  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-人群定向、DMP 与 RTA\",\"巨量本地推-本地推\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\",\"巨量本地推\"],\"capability_summary\":\"该接口用于查询站内媒体渠道的RTA联合实验数据，支持分天t+1级别数据。由于数据更新时间存在波动性，建议可以在查询当日上午12点后尝试拉取前一天的数据。配合接口有【获取Access token】。\",\"id\":\"report.rta_exp_local_daily.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/report/rta_exp_local_daily/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1743460024243204\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"请求该接口需要通过此接口获取授权access_token\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1743460024243204\",\"title\":\"获取站内媒体RTA联合实验数据（分天t+1）\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-IZFPMW8q\" id=\"link-0\">功能</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-kbkeZvAh\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">该接口用于查询站内媒体渠道的RTA联合实验数据，支持分天t+1级别数据</span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-VpSjY5kf\"><strong>注</strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">：由于数据更新时间存在波动性，建议可以在查询当日上午12点后尝试拉取前一天的数据</span></p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201743755012805635%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-kZVZK6qL\" id=\"link-1\">请求地址</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-E3OnqAFE\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/report/rta_exp_local_daily/get/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/report/rta_exp_local_daily/get/</span></a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1743460024243204\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-xCC9btE9\" id=\"link-2\">请求方法</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-73LcJeAo\">GET</p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-TuUYtarP\" id=\"link-3\">Header</h3><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t615773a-lM1IQFbV\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-JPO7KS7G\"><col data-id=\"cd11d5e0-Q2QGW2QQ\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"cd11d5e0-nj4hJhEm\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"cd11d5e0-4B0nZCmj\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-A1VAmgZ0\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-L7OaEcaQ\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-AiFGgRmK\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-PhIgN0jh\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-R9HZaSd4\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-1B3JjBdG\">类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-8YDDEd1k\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-RVkfF9gD\">描述</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-E7Mhba2O\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-bWmi0ClD\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-miDaXSTC\">Access-Token<span style=\"color: #338aff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ebf3ff;\">必填</span></span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-IX1c4UgN\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-8qCMkI0J\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tb871063-CkIjmRTg\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ckf1YHdm\">授权access_token，可以通过<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">【获取Access token】</a>接口获取</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-55pBsJb7\" id=\"link-4\">请求参数</h3><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t3945309-6B5E6ET9\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-Cnc81GZC\"><col data-id=\"c3bb27f1-aRjIWiXD\" span=\"1\" width=\"29.351535836177472%\"/><col data-id=\"c3bb27f1-n9nYKeW8\" span=\"1\" width=\"29.351535836177472%\"/><col data-id=\"c616fa3c-ZILXAPWE\" span=\"1\" width=\"41.29692832764505%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-kQV9a2Vk\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-O5oDfXS3\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-I8ITN2kW\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-anTFh8H9\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-eTERBLGo\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-MjsiUNFp\">类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-KUMl3MXD\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-bFp2Q0qG\">描述</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-WWL6994G\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-cKJ9MW7R\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-j6bGk5k0\">advertiser_id<span style=\"color: #338aff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ebf3ff;\">必填</span></span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-D8BN2D3a\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-gvp7dnLT\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-93K2Gg1Q\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-rJb5rgMS\">客户ID</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-ZcjqafIe\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-UVEGADFX\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-p6VuwY53\">rta_id<span style=\"color: #338aff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ebf3ff;\">必填</span></span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-S3oXE4To\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-isdPZUWI\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-mJhKk1R9\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-bwho5LIR\">RTA ID</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-IZhlUYmS\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-1oMQmf3e\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-z5LVcO2u\">start_date<span style=\"color: #338aff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ebf3ff;\">必填</span></span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-319mJUVX\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-p8ZrIt88\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-bU5WG7m4\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-urEyVUXi\">开始日期，格式YYYYMMDD，示例：20220828；注：历史数据最早可回溯到8月1号0点；最大查询跨度为10天；只支持查询当日前90天内的数据</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-iPVIVRcC\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-sAeo6rWd\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-YUtTDhVc\">end_date<span style=\"color: #338aff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ebf3ff;\">必填</span></span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-qh5kdN1n\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-DArsq5Hk\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-MB6RCMHA\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-pcRBqX45\">结束日期，格式YYYYMMDD，示例：20220902；注：历史数据最早可回溯到8月1号0点；最大查询跨度为10天；只支持查询当日前90天内的数据</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-bP1mA9US\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-ut1YEd7Y\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-PWW2chYE\">vid</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-LC7IbHdt\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ca9Arv4O\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-c2pY3FEA\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-glFCXdpz\">联合实验组唯一标识，共10个实验分桶标记。若使用该数据报表，务必在入参中携带cus_vid或者vid二者之一，若为空则报错。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-9Uw69wGj\">注：联系对接销售/运营咨询获取vid</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-eB4mapP6\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-c5cS5lGc\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-vMarEhhD\">cus_vid</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-Qc2oDKrX\"><br/></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-PefQWL64\"><br/></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-ciFiSTD3\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-K2jNsUFF\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t7e901cd-mVXU6D8g\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-fNSY7aT1\">客户自行开分桶实验的唯一标识，一共10个枚举值（1~10）。若使用该数据报表，务必在入参中携带cus_vid或者vid二者之一，若为空则报错。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-qOCcp7JU\">注：cus_vid和vid不能同时使用，同时入参；如有特殊需求，联系对接销售/运营咨询。</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-dORvBV7G\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-5fZ2eQbC\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-poLpiQBP\">filtering</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-gPZD3IKD\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-lQyJIq1u\">object</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t00cbcc2-WJNLDhHh\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ae3si9Sl\">过滤条件</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-jdEBYp42\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t8e94736-8NIk6aVH\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-oCFg9z2S\"><span class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-1\" data-level=\"1\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A1%2C%22id%22%3A%22Epmbu%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\"> </span>bid_coef</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t8e94736-EC8gTUQT\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-gDvkPP84\">string[]</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t5bc59a3-EMP1f7dl\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-OwyACncc\">出价系数取数区间。枚举值：</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-1K09jHkR\"><strong>0~3.0之间，是301个coef字段（0.01为一个步长，</strong><strong>300+0）</strong></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-FBAlBxuX\">枚举值举例：<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">COEF_0</code>（表示系数为0）、<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">COEF_BETWEEN_0_0.01</code>（表示系数区间为(0,0.01)）、<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">COEF_BETWEEN_0.01_0.02</code>（表示系数区间为[0.01,0.02)）、<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">COEF_BETWEEN_0.02_0.03</code>（表示系数区间为[0.02,0.03)）......<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">COEF_BETWEEN_2.99_3.00</code>（表示系数区间为[2.99,3.00)）</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-q4xSsdAz\"><strong>3~5之间，是40个coef字段（0.05为一个步长，系数3取数：[3.0,3.05)）</strong></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-3CopEDKz\">枚举值举例：<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">COEF_BETWEEN_3.00_3.05</code>（表示系数区间为[3.00,3.05)）、<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">COEF_BETWEEN_3.05_3.10</code>（表示系数区间为[3.05,3.10)）......<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">COEF_BETWEEN_4.95_5.00</code>（表示系数区间为[4.95,5.00)）</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-6jG3CpLa\"><strong>大于5无变化，保持为COEF_ABOVE_5.0（表示系数大于等于5）</strong></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-E8rKpXm2\"><br/></p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-n6jAMRdN\" id=\"link-5\">请求示例</h3><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2Fv3.0%2Freport%2Frta_exp_local_hourly%2Fget%2F%5C%22%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cndef%20get(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Send%20GET%20request%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20json_str%3A%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Response%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20args%20%